{"id":"n65361-3-7","stage":5,"title":"스며들다 · 渗透","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n65361-3-7-1","ko":"지수는 정말 어른들에게 인사를 잘하더라.","zh":"智秀真的很会跟长辈打招呼呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수는","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"지수는","audio":"/audio/9ca6ce32d0646be4023e.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수는","audio":"/audio/9ca6ce32d0646be4023e.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61174","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"어른들에게","meaning":"长辈，长者","explanation":"어른：长辈，长者；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"어른","audio":"/audio/00bcc9cf309036598111.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72574","senseId":"2","lemma":"어른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어른들에게","audio":"/audio/0afb3b872fc4325b8f14.mp3"}},{"text":"인사를","meaning":"问候，打招呼","explanation":"인사：问候，打招呼；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"인사","audio":"/audio/ae353e9482abc103f0f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66311","senseId":"1","lemma":"인사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"인사를","audio":"/audio/79a063d27a29b9e39195.mp3"}},{"text":"잘하더라.","meaning":"善于，擅长","explanation":"잘하다：善于，擅长；더라：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"잘하다","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70073","senseId":"3","lemma":"잘하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘하더라","audio":"/audio/00f4549dd7e8a06cd97d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61174","definition":"没有虚假而真正地。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"00bcc9cf30903659","term":"어른","zh":"长辈，长者","audio":"/audio/00bcc9cf309036598111.mp3","entryId":"72574","definition":"年龄、地位等高的前辈。","pronunciation":["어ː른"]},{"id":"ae353e9482abc103","term":"인사","zh":"问候，打招呼","audio":"/audio/ae353e9482abc103f0f3.mp3","entryId":"66311","definition":"见面或告别时表现地有礼节，或指那样的言行。","pronunciation":["인사"]},{"id":"039fa50765b5cd6f","term":"잘하다","zh":"善于，擅长","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3","entryId":"70073","definition":"熟练且手艺好。","pronunciation":["잘하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/06b3744dab3595cdd524.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n65361-3-7-2","ko":"어렸을 때부터 인사하는 습관이 생활에 스며들어 있어.","zh":"她从小就有打招呼的习惯，这已经成了她生活的一部分。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어렸을","meaning":"年龄小","explanation":"어리다：年龄小；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"어리다","audio":"/audio/ec54bee5939613d498c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74176","senseId":"2","lemma":"어리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어렸을","audio":"/audio/314f3a56783f02be9cd3.mp3"}},{"text":"때부터","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"때：时，时候；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"1","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때부터","audio":"/audio/0afde5432108ccb6dc1b.mp3"}},{"text":"인사하는","meaning":"问候，打招呼","explanation":"인사하다：问候，打招呼；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"인사하다","audio":"/audio/fcac58187243534b5213.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17178","senseId":"1","lemma":"인사하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"인사하는","audio":"/audio/856331cae0a883669544.mp3"}},{"text":"습관이","meaning":"习惯","explanation":"습관：习惯；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"습관","audio":"/audio/04694ae7655dfa6742aa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65105","senseId":"1","lemma":"습관","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"습관이","audio":"/audio/63d3e692da7e4d145b7b.mp3"}},{"text":"생활에","meaning":"生活","explanation":"생활：生活；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"생활","audio":"/audio/6a739e74f8dfb7fbc5ec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74183","senseId":"4","lemma":"생활","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생활에","audio":"/audio/da37def5e29ff88b4e06.mp3"}},{"text":"스며들어","meaning":"渗透","explanation":"스며들다：渗透；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"스며들다","audio":"/audio/6242ef1ec9e6c724b6f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65361","senseId":"3","lemma":"스며들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"스며들어","audio":"/audio/52fc27201aae7538a5bd.mp3"}},{"text":"있어.","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어","audio":"/audio/675a95c70a831521b983.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ec54bee5939613d4","term":"어리다","zh":"年龄小","audio":"/audio/ec54bee5939613d498c9.mp3","entryId":"74176","definition":"年纪小于比较对象。","pronunciation":["어리다"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"时，时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"指某一瞬间或时间段。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"fcac58187243534b","term":"인사하다","zh":"问候，打招呼","audio":"/audio/fcac58187243534b5213.mp3","entryId":"17178","definition":"见面或分开时表现得有礼节。","pronunciation":["인사하다"]},{"id":"04694ae7655dfa67","term":"습관","zh":"习惯","audio":"/audio/04694ae7655dfa6742aa.mp3","entryId":"65105","definition":"在长时间重复的过程中自然熟悉的行动方式。","pronunciation":["습꽌"]},{"id":"6a739e74f8dfb7fb","term":"생활","zh":"生活","audio":"/audio/6a739e74f8dfb7fbc5ec.mp3","entryId":"74183","definition":"做某事或某个活动度日；或指那样的状态。","pronunciation":["생활"]},{"id":"6242ef1ec9e6c724","term":"스며들다","zh":"渗透","audio":"/audio/6242ef1ec9e6c724b6f8.mp3","entryId":"65361","definition":"某种想法或态度等渗透进去后变得熟悉或成为一部分。","pronunciation":["스며들다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/90651a90eb909d7728ef.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.262,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=65361","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"고급","day":156,"sequenceScore":3.0887,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["她从小就有打招呼的习惯，这已经成了她生活的一部分。","如果在绿色包装纸上系条黄色丝带怎么样？","智秀真的很会跟长辈打招呼呢。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["她从小就有打招呼的习惯，这已经成了她生活的一部分。","智秀真的很会跟长辈打招呼呢。","如果在绿色包装纸上系条黄色丝带怎么样？"],"answer":0}]}
